    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>3级 杂兵 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物（水生）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 14，''强韧'' 12，''反射'' 14，''意志'' 12</span><span>''侦查'' +0</span></div>\n<div><span>''抗力'' 5 毒</span><span></span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6（沼泽行者），游泳 4</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/aura}}腐烂恶臭（毒素）</div>\n<div class=description>灵气 2：所有在该灵气内花费复原力的敌人虚弱直到其下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">素</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">自然释放（医疗）</div>\n<div class=description>任何对霸蛙人蛙鸣者造成重击的攻击者恢复 3 点生命值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}爪击✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+6 vs. AC<br>命中：7 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/close}}纠缠蛙鸣（毒素）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近程冲击 2，+4 vs. 强韧<br>命中：4 点毒素伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+6</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 10（+1）</span><span>''敏捷'' 14（+3）</span><span>''感知'' 10（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 14（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 6（-1）</span><span>''魅力'' 5（-2）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 荒神语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
